  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Audit Board</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to fund the functioning of the Audit Board of the Ukraine Facility. Pursuant to article 36 of the Ukraine Facility Regulation, the Audit Board was established.The Audit Board will be composed by three independent members, selected and appointed by the Commission following a call for manifestation of interest. The Board Members will be based in Brussels and will travel to Ukraine several times per year.The Audit Board members will be supported by a team of Kyiv-based experts and consultants which will act as the Audit Board&#xBF;s &#xBF;secretariat&#xBF;. The secretariat will operate under the authority and supervision of Commission staff. This action enables the Commission to:- fund the remuneration and mission expenses of the Audit Board Members;- procure the services required to operate the secretariat of the Audit Board.</narrative>
  </description>
